# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo *and* in the working tree on
# every platform. Rust tooling (cargo, rustfmt) emits LF, so pinning the
# working tree to LF as well keeps Windows checkouts from churning diffs
# or fighting rustfmt. Overrides any user-level `core.autocrlf` setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary (do not touch line endings or attempt text diffs)
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
